WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Quick guide: contribute a sign. It only takes a few minutes.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Create an account with your email. If you already have one, sign in.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Open Contribute data and choose the sign you want to record.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Allow the browser to use your camera. Stand somewhere well lit and keep both hands fully in frame.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Press record, make the sign, then review it. If you are not happy, record again.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Send your recording. A reviewer checks it before the data is used.

7
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Every sign you contribute helps machines recognise sign language better.
